00:55:35.320 --> 00:55:42.890
<v Ira Glass>In the years since we first ran our story about Will Ream, the guy in the last act-- he's now back in Salt Lake, working a construction job. He says they're all doing well.
<v Ira Glass>自从我们第一次播出关于Will Ream的故事以来，也就是最后一幕里的那个家伙——他现在回到了盐湖城，从事建筑工作。他说他们都过得很好。

00:55:42.890 --> 00:55:56.010
